# Home grid status strip (clock, Wi-Fi bars, Bluetooth glyph) in its states, then keyboard focus
# moved off the first tile. The strip polls every 2 s, so each state change waits 2.1 s.
title home status
apps Settings Store CLI Python SSH "IP Panel" Calculator Snake Tank
clock 09:41
wifi off
bt off
home
shot status_offline
wifi 25
bt on
wait 2100
shot status_weak_bt_on
wifi 95
bt connected
clock 23:59
wait 2100
shot status_full_bt_connected
key DOWN
key RIGHT
shot home_focus_moved
key DOWN
shot home_scrolled
